1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,060
Woman: Welcome to the student housing office. What can I do for you?

2
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:10,800
Man: Hi, I'm looking for a 2 bedroom apartment

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,260
and I wondered if you have some available?

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,040
Woman: Yes we do.

5
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,090
Man: How much is the rent?

6
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:18,240
Woman: Standard is $1800 a month

7
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:23,190
but we also have some with a nice view of the lake. Those are 21 hundred.

8
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:25,140
Man: 21 hundred is a bit much

9
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:28,190
Do you mind if I have a look at one of the standard 2 bedrooms?

10
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:32,070
Woman: Of course. Let me grab the key from the drawer.
